Z||000000||Fiero_24||12-09-2001||11:23 PM||||Just got back from starting up my 1987GT with the new performance motor.  I did a Fiero Store performance rebuild, and a few extra options.  All I have to do now is finish adjusting the valves and put the valve covers back on.  What a rush hearing the new deep tone for the first time in 4 months.  I can't wait to get her back on the road next weekend!<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/driverside41.jpg"> <BR>  <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24</A> <BR>1987 GT||||reg||6
