Z||000002||Fiero_24||12-10-2001||10:12 AM||||I plan a Rice hunt next Saturday.  I did the swap in WI where my parents live, and there are a bunch of crappy rice burners and a fake Lambo.  I beat the kit lambo with my 85GT and a 4:10 tranny.  The guy with a lambo says its real even with the Fiero seats and dash, too bad he got beat by another Fiero.  The only bad part was that I had the ferrari tail lamps on my car, so they thought a Ferrari and a lambo were racing (even with the tail lamps I still don't think my Fiero looked like a Ferrari).<P>Craig||||reg||4
